# Applies to builds whose context is the repo root — bff-*, token-handler, web SPA
# images, etc. Excludes heavy artifacts (node_modules, dist) everywhere; web source
# trees are included only as needed by each Dockerfile's COPY lines.
.git
.idea
**/.gradle
**/build
**/node_modules
**/dist
domains/*/web/node_modules
domains/*/web/dist
keycloak
proxy
*.md
*.drawio
